<p><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Ftravel.state.gov%252Fen%252Finternational-travel%252Ftravel-advisories%252Fethiopia.html%2F2%2F010101a14140981d-5753cb82-0f1d-4a2d-a812-4a2e88d4c1c6-000000%2FAPeOOaNBq82VM11291IL1qWqpoIqKoxLmIZW6K_wRWY%3D452&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMesfinD%40state.gov%7Cc03369aca6494b8c055b08df2b3ff729%7C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%7C0%7C0%7C639277225924041310%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=ccoyhd6b7RZy0RWwUu6MIFC2IQAe17FqV5Tfsj%2FB%2Bko%3D&amp;reserved=0">Ethiopia International Travel Information</a></p>
<p>Enroll in <a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2FCL0%2Fhttps%3A%252F%252Fmytravel.state.gov%252Fs%252Fstep%2F2%2F010101a14140981d-5753cb82-0f1d-4a2d-a812-4a2e88d4c1c6-000000%2FqyZqd0_k7oRYX-Biihxk2crEbaaPn0UCvY_qYr5wC68%3D452&amp;data=05%7C02%7CMesfinD%40state.gov%7Cc03369aca6494b8c055b08df2b3ff729%7C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%7C0%7C0%7C639277225924061582%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=jt68cFnQNUwAZGSICyMX8lWiJ6XAmbcwT2wWXg6hO7c%3D&amp;reserved=0">Smart Traveler Enrollment Program (STEP)</a> to receive security and health updates.</p>
</p>

				
